%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 60, "messageMargin": 30}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser (React App)
    participant API as Image API (Express)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(local)
    participant Spaces as DigitalOcean Spaces<br/>(cloud, S3-compatible, private bucket)

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    note over User,Spaces: Upload (profile picture or event image)
    User->>API: POST /me/profile/image<br/>multipart file + Firebase ID token
    API->>API: verify ID token + email_verified
    API->>API: validate file (type, size ≤ 5MB)
    API->>Spaces: PutObject<br/>key = profile-images/{uid}/{uuid}.ext
    Spaces-->>API: 200 OK
    API->>DB: UPDATE app_users<br/>SET profile_image_key = new key<br/>(returns previous key)
    DB-->>API: previous_key
    API->>Spaces: DeleteObject(previous_key)<br/>best-effort, same owner prefix only
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 238)
    note over User,Spaces: View (profile card, event card, chat, ...)
    API->>Spaces: GetObject presigned URL request<br/>(expires in 900s)
    Spaces-->>API: signed, time-limited URL
    API-->>User: { imageUrl: <signed URL> }
    User->>Spaces: GET signed URL (direct download)
    Spaces-->>User: image bytes
    note right of Spaces: Bytes never pass through<br/>the API server
    end
